  <header>
    <h1>Gabelli School of Business: Graduate Admissions</h1>
    <p>RamBot demo page (portfolio project, not an official Fordham site)</p>
  </header>
  <main>
    <p>Use the chat button in the lower right to talk to RamBot. Try asking which program fits you, what a program costs, when the next info session is, or about an application status (for example A-1003 with priya.shah@example.com).</p>
    <div class="note">To test the human handoff, set yourself to "Available - Messaging" in the Omni-Channel utility of the Service Console first, then ask RamBot for a real person.</div>
    <div class="crisis" role="note">If you are thinking about hurting yourself or are in crisis, you don't have to wait for a chatbot: call or text <strong>988</strong> (Suicide and Crisis Lifeline, US) any time, or call <strong>911</strong> if you are in immediate danger. Outside the US, contact your local emergency number.</div>
  </main>
  <script type='text/javascript'>
